# Scripts Structure

## Bash only — no PowerShell, no cmd

All git/cargo/scripts: `C:\msys64\usr\bin\bash.exe`. New scripts: `scripts/*.sh` or `bin/*.sh`. **Never** add `.ps1`.

```
scripts/          kit helpers (disk, git push, skill mirrors)
bin/              product wrappers (record-test-speed, record-rust-diagnostics, gsv-vision-sync)
src/bin/          Rust bins only (`cargo run --bin …`)
```

When adding a script: put it in `scripts/` or `bin/`, document it in `scripts/README.md`, no Python.
